---
---How fast this crafting machine can craft. 1 means that for example a 1 second long recipe take 1 second to craft. 0.5 means it takes 2 seconds, and 2 means it takes 0.5 seconds.
---
---Crafting speed has to be positive.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/CraftingMachinePrototype.html%23crafting_speed#crafting_speed)
---@field crafting_speed double
---@
---
---Each value must be >= 0.01.
---
---If value is not provided for a quality, then [QualityPrototype::crafting\_machine\_speed\_multiplier](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/QualityPrototype.html%23crafting_machine_speed_multiplier#crafting_machine_speed_multiplier) will be used as a speed multiplier instead.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/CraftingMachinePrototype.html%23crafting_speed_quality_multiplier#crafting_speed_quality_multiplier)
---@field crafting_speed_quality_multiplier? table<QualityID,double>
