---The crafting machine's fluid boxes. If an assembling machine has fluid boxes *and* [AssemblingMachinePrototype::fluid\_boxes\_off\_when\_no\_fluid\_recipe](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/AssemblingMachinePrototype.html%23fluid_boxes_off_when_no_fluid_recipe#fluid_boxes_off_when_no_fluid_recipe) is true, the assembling machine can only be rotated when a recipe consuming or producing fluid is set, or if it has one of the other properties listed at the top of this page.
